## Stack-specific project rules (`project-rule_[TECH]_[LANGUAGE].mdc`)

This file defines the **full breadth** of standards. Tech-specific rules must **cover the same topics** (adapted naming, paths, libraries, and examples — not a shortened checklist). Use web research on official docs and style guides for the stack. The `/cook` command documents required depth and a section-by-section checklist in `.claude/commands/cook.prompt.md` (Step 0.0.2a); generated rules should include a `## References consulted` section listing sources used.

