- **Usage:** Select the template that matches the product stack; copy **one tier** (or merge tiers deliberately), then **expand** until every section in **this** common file has an adapted equivalent. Templates **do not replace** `project_rule_common.mdc` — they accelerate stack-appropriate detail and scale-appropriate rules.